; Import library for ntoskrnl.exe (Windows ARM64); only what our drivers call. Build: llvm-dlltool -m arm64 -d ntoskrnl.def -l libntoskrnl.a
LIBRARY ntoskrnl.exe
EXPORTS
DbgPrint
DbgPrintEx
RtlInitUnicodeString
ZwCreateFile
ZwWriteFile
ZwReadFile
ZwClose
ZwQuerySystemInformation
KeQuerySystemTimePrecise
KeDelayExecutionThread
KeStallExecutionProcessor
ExAllocatePool2
ExFreePoolWithTag
MmMapIoSpaceEx
MmUnmapIoSpace
MmGetSystemRoutineAddress
IoCreateDevice
IoDeleteDevice
IofCompleteRequest
PsCreateSystemThread
PsTerminateSystemThread
ObReferenceObjectByHandle
ObfDereferenceObject
_vsnprintf
IofCallDriver
PoCallDriver
PoStartNextPowerIrp
IoReleaseCancelSpinLock
KeInitializeEvent
KeSetEvent
KeWaitForSingleObject
KeAcquireSpinLockRaiseToDpc
KeReleaseSpinLock
ExSetTimerResolution
ZwOpenKey
ZwQueryValueKey
